tests/output/
/tests/**/*.pkl
!src/stages/**/models/*.pkl

# ── Player state (AUD-035 / AUD-052) ──────────────────────────
# `saves/slot_1.json` y `data/inventory.json` siguieron apareciendo en cada
# diff después de ignorarlos, porque .gitignore no afecta a archivos que YA
# están rastreados. Hay que sacarlos del índice una vez:
#     git rm --cached saves/slot_1.json data/inventory.json
# Mientras estén rastreados, cada partida jugada produce un diff espurio y el
# repositorio viaja con el progreso de un desarrollador dentro.
# Save files are per-player runtime state, not source. `saves/slot_1.json` was
# committed, which meant every clone of the repository shipped with one
# developer's half-finished playthrough — and every playtest session produced
# a spurious diff.
#
# AUD-197 — `data/achievements.json` ya no es estado de partida: es el
# catálogo de definiciones (el progreso vive en `user_data_dir()`), así que
# dejó de estar ignorado y viaja con el repositorio.
saves/
*.sav
data/inventory.json

# ── Editor / workspace cruft (AUD-035) ─────────────────────────
.vscode/settings.json
.obsidian/
.smart-env/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# ── Working files that must never be committed (AUD-034) ───────
# Ad-hoc debug scripts, patches and map backups belong in .archive/ (which is
# also ignored) or in a branch — not in the repository root, where they were
# indistinguishable from real tooling.
.archive/
*.backup
*.backup[0-9]
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*_backup/
saves/academico/
